<% if(it.question){ %><%= it.question %><% } else { %>Answer the person's latest request already present in the inherited conversation.<% } %>
<% if(it.kind === "auto"){ %>Choose the report kind that fits this request: prose, table, or checklist. For prose, result holds the complete answer. For table or checklist, result must be only a short introductory sentence; all rows or items belong exclusively in the typed field. Never put the same rows or items in result as well.<% } else { %>Presentation: <%= it.kind %>.<% } %> Use the report tool when returning a structured component. Use tools only if needed to answer accurately. Keep the person's requested scope and detail.
